# Olivetti M20 native CP/M-8000 hard-disk filesystem.
#
# The M20 BIOS exposes each physical head as two 16-sector logical tracks.
# The DPB in src/cpm8k/bios.c is:
#   spt=32, bsh=5, dsm=2154, drm=511, al0=f0, off=3
# Here cpmtools sectors are physical 256-byte sectors, hence sectrk=16.
# 2158 logical tracks = 3 reserved tracks + 2155 allocation blocks.
diskdef m20hd
  seclen 256
  tracks 2158
  sectrk 16
  blocksize 4096
  maxdir 512
  boottrk 3
  os 2.2
end
